# {{name_title}}

A 3D first-person shooter game built with the Game Engine.

## Features

- 3D rendering with PBR lighting
- First-person camera controller
- Weapon system
- Enemy AI
- 3D physics simulation
- Level loading

## Getting Started

### Building

```bash
cargo build
cargo run
```

## Game Controls

- W/A/S/D: Move
- Mouse: Look around
- Left Click: Shoot
- Right Click: Aim
- R: Reload
- Space: Jump
- Shift: Sprint

## Level Design

Levels are defined in the `assets/maps/` directory.

## Assets

Place your 3D models in `assets/models/` (GLTF/FBX format).
Place textures in `assets/textures/`.
Place sounds in `assets/audio/`.

